Participant --> UC19
Participant --> UC21
Participant --> UC23

System --> UC15
System --> UC20

Support --> UC23
Support --> UC24

UC10 ..> UC22 : <<include>>
UC11 ..> UC22 : <<include>>
UC12 ..> UC22 : <<include>>
UC15 ..> UC22 : <<include>>
UC16 ..> UC22 : <<include>>
UC20 ..> UC22 : <<include>>
UC23 ..> UC22 : <<include>>
UC24 ..> UC22 : <<include>>

@enduml
